Author: Artem Lavrukhin <lavryha4590@gmail.com>
Description: Keep image-list alpha flags aligned with their images.
 When ImageList_Remove deletes an image, shift and clear its flags.
 Set the alpha flag from each added or replaced image so a reused slot
 cannot inherit alpha blending from an older icon.
